{"id":"f6a57904f836e3e9","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-universal-tm-simulation.md","title":"73-thm-universal-tm-simulation — universal tm simulation","display":"73-thm-universal-tm-simulation — universal tm simulation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-universal-tm-simulation","display":"73-thm-universal-tm-simulation — universal tm simulation","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]","[[73-thm-binary-universal-machine]]"],"aliases":["73-thm-universal-tm-simulation","73-theorem-4.1"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-universal-tm-simulation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-thm-universal-tm-simulation — universal tm simulation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8630ed136c8dde2d\" href=\"?note=8630ed136c8dde2d\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-runs\">73-df-dtm-finite-runs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"17b3325184317072\" href=\"?note=17b3325184317072\" title=\"73-thm-binary-universal-machine\">73-thm-binary-universal-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-universal-tm-simulation</span><span>73-theorem-4.1</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle M,w\\rangle=\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\langle M,w\\rangle=\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>本编码上下文中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 为规范机器描述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\)</span>；任意有限二进制输入机器先按该文件规定重命名状态和带字母，不能给任意集合标签直接分配一个未经说明的自然数编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Accept},\\operatorname{Reject},C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Accept},\\operatorname{Reject},C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Halting},\\to_M^*\">\\(\\operatorname{Halting},\\to_M^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8630ed136c8dde2d\" href=\"?note=8630ed136c8dde2d\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-runs\">73-df-dtm-finite-runs</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Halts}\">\\(\\operatorname{Halts}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b9e8acd6d8438a5d\" href=\"?note=b9e8acd6d8438a5d\" title=\"73-df-binary-diagonal-halting\">73-df-binary-diagonal-halting</a>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\">\\(M=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank}\">\\(Q,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank}\\)</span> 总是该机器的分量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,w\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(u,w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}(M(w))\\downarrow=u\">\\(\\operatorname{out}(M(w))\\downarrow=u\\)</span> 在此表示下式定义的规范终态词输出图，保持词输出调用名。原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U(\\langle M,w\\rangle)=M(w)\">\\(U(\\langle M,w\\rangle)=M(w)\\)</span> 展开为接受、拒绝、停机及输出图的对应，不要求配置表示逐项相同。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}4.1}\\vdash\n\\langle M,w\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\quad(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}},\\ w\\in\\mathbf2^*)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}4.1}\\vdash\n\\langle M,w\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\quad(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}},\\ w\\in\\mathbf2^*)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}4.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}4.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}4.1}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{out}(M(w))\\downarrow=u\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists q\\in Q\\;\\exists T\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_M^*(q,T,h)\\land\\operatorname{Halting}_M((q,T,h))\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;((0\\le i&lt;|u|\\to T(i)=u(i))\\land(i&lt;0\\lor|u|\\le i\\to T(i)=\\mathrm{blank}))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}4.1}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{out}(M(w))\\downarrow=u\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists q\\in Q\\;\\exists T\\in\\Gamma^{\\mathbb Z}\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(w)\\to_M^*(q,T,h)\\land\\operatorname{Halting}_M((q,T,h))\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;((0\\le i&lt;|u|\\to T(i)=u(i))\\land(i&lt;0\\lor|u|\\le i\\to T(i)=\\mathrm{blank}))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}4.1}\\vdash\n\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\bigl((\\operatorname{Accept}_U(\\langle M,w\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w))\n\\land(\\operatorname{Reject}_U(\\langle M,w\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_M(w))\n\\land(\\operatorname{Halts}_U(\\langle M,w\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w))\n\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;(\\operatorname{out}(U(\\langle M,w\\rangle))\\downarrow=u\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{out}(M(w))\\downarrow=u)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}4.1}\\vdash\n\\exists U\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\bigl((\\operatorname{Accept}_U(\\langle M,w\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w))\n\\land(\\operatorname{Reject}_U(\\langle M,w\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_M(w))\n\\land(\\operatorname{Halts}_U(\\langle M,w\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w))\n\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;(\\operatorname{out}(U(\\langle M,w\\rangle))\\downarrow=u\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{out}(M(w))\\downarrow=u)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>通用机在有限编码的虚拟带上模拟每一步。模拟终止时，若虚拟终态是规范词输出，则清理模拟数据并复制该词；否则留下一个非输出标记。随后进入对应接受或拒绝状态。清理有限已访问区间总会终止，因此既保持所有输入的停机/发散行为，也保持完整的词输出图，而不是仅保持识别语言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},